      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design a feature flag / experimentation platform — \nSupport gradual rollouts, \nA/B testing - Alpha is Old and Beta is new,\nkill switches for thousands of configs read by microservices. \nAddress low-latency flag evaluation, statistical significance, and safe rollback.",
